OL,3,ALost songs from iconic Australian
OL,4,Arockstar found in garage
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a decade after her death, the
OL,7,Fvoice of Australian rock icon Chrissy
OL,8,FAmphlett will be heard like never
OL,9,Fbefore after three lost songs were
OL,10,Fdiscovered in a garage.
OL,12,FThe trailblazing frontwoman of rock
OL,13,Fband Divinyls, Amphlett's trademark
OL,14,Fhusky voice and charismatic stage
OL,15,Fpresence brought the world the 1990
OL,16,Fnumber one track I Touch Myself as well
OL,17,Fas earlier hits Pleasure and Pain
OL,18,F(1985) and Boys in Town (1981).
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
