OL,3,ALost songs from iconic Australian
OL,4,Arockstar found in garage
OL,5,
OL,6,FYears before her 2013 death, Amphlett
OL,7,Frecorded three songs with Tim Finn,
OL,8,Fformer lead singer of New Zealand's
OL,9,FSplit Enz, in 1998. The tracks were
OL,10,Fthought to be lost until Finn found
OL,11,Fthem in his garage in 2023.
OL,13,FOn Friday, the songs will be released
OL,14,Fon an EP titled Some Times.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
